Um, I came here to see the True Ending.

1033
01:01:31,519 --> 01:01:33,719
わし真エンディングを見に来て...
I came to see the True Ending...

1034
01:01:34,619 --> 01:01:35,419
はい。
Yes.

1035
01:01:35,519 --> 01:01:36,619
実わ...
Actually...

1036
01:01:37,519 --> 01:01:39,319
真エンディングを見に来て...
I came to see the True Ending...

1037
01:01:40,419 --> 01:01:41,319
