and I was...

1041
01:01:48,319 --> 01:01:49,719
いたのでっすが...
doing, but...

1042
01:01:50,519 --> 01:01:52,919
え！？ 何何何何何、ねぇやめてやめて！
Eh!? What what what what what, hey stop it, stop!

1043
01:01:53,019 --> 01:01:54,919
なー何何、今今何があった！？
Wh-what what, what just happened right now!?

1044
01:01:55,019 --> 01:01:55,919
ねぇ今何があった！？
Hey, what just happened!?

1045
01:01:56,019 --> 01:01:57,019
